        <section><h3>Some properties of the Operation of Union</h3>
            <ol><li>\\(A - B \\neq B - A\\) (in general)</li>
                <li>\\(A - \\phi = A\\) (Law of identity element)</li>
                <li>\\(A - A = \\phi\\) </li>
                <li>The sets \\(A-B, A\\cap B\\) and \\(B - A\\) are mutually disjoint.</li></ol></section>
        
        
